{"title":"1969 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution  1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution  2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution  3</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find the sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/1/771bab7e334febe6e85efd47990c6b29c0421f14.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1\\cdot 1!+2\\cdot 2!+3\\cdot 3!+\\cdots+(n-1)(n-1)!+n\\cdot n!$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"397\" height=\"18\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/d/7fdc1ad03d131ed6430671450ffec6a6e65cecca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n!=n(n-1)(n-2)\\cdots2\\cdot1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"221\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution  1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution  1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that for any <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Positive_integer\" title=\"Positive integer\">positive integer</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/4/c54e7152acd659788861f0453ac195c635e0a005.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/2/b9219bfc3ab644267768acf6c00aed525594bf44.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n\\cdot n!+(n-1)\\cdot(n-1)!=(n^2+n-1)(n-1)!=(n+1)!-(n-1)!.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"548\" height=\"19\" />\nHence, pairing terms in the series will telescope most of the terms.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Odd_integer\" title=\"Odd integer\"> odd</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/2/9d2bf3eb2a8d9a2359ee6b12dc4cac978c9e7682.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(n+1)!-(n-1)!+(n-1)!-(n-3)!\\cdots -2!+2!-0!.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"449\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Even_integer\" title=\"Even integer\"> even</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/d/e1df34f4ea852dd95496945cfc5bad04c920c99a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(n+1)!-(n-1)!+(n-1)!-(n-3)!\\cdots -3!+3!-1!.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"449\" height=\"18\" />\nIn both cases, the expression telescopes into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/0/e508bdfa1694fc3394a47e6f23a3205015da7848.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(n+1)!-1.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"96\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution  2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution  2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We need to evaluate:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/9/8e939967d601e87d0843bbb9bbe45a3ecc95341b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[1\\cdot 1!+2\\cdot 2!+\\cdots+(n-1)(n-1)!+n\\cdot n!\\]\" width=\"338\" height=\"18\" />\nWe replace <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/5/0152e365767cf8e63309ad340255d1951afcbab9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k\\cdot k!$\" width=\"36\" height=\"13\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/3/1938d93d142c86303656211ba2731e830c795963.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$((k+1)-1)\\cdot k!$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"127\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/7/5f7f2ffbb0f03e85440220174016b6ea16ec0404.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(2-1)\\cdot 1!+(3-1)\\cdot 2!+\\cdots+((n)-1)(n-1)!+((n+1)-1)\\cdot n!\\]\" width=\"477\" height=\"18\" />\nDistribution yields\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/986a794be40d317825d5f56512768c170dfa11d5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(2\\cdot 1!-1\\cdot1!+3\\cdot2!-1\\cdot2!+\\cdots+n(n-1)!-1(n-1)!+(n+1)n!-1\\cdot n!\\]\" width=\"477\" height=\"18\" />\nSimplifying,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/b/b2beae3cc1eefe8ae56534fefb39167d582f02a1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2!-1!+3!-2!+\\cdots+n!-(n-1)!+(n+1)!-n!\\]\" width=\"408\" height=\"18\" />\nWhich telescopes to\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/3/5c321cf3a9620426b799582c86be54c46548d227.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(n+1)!-1!=(n+1)!-1\\]\" width=\"212\" height=\"18\" />\nSo <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/9/ee999103f35c9222dca6adc30d7234704c22fecd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(n+1)!-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"91\" height=\"18\" /> is the solution.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution  3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution  3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/7/7c7ebea989fb5dfb1cf471857ab8eed757a61b42.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S=\\sum_{k=1}^{n}k\\cdot k!=\\sum_{k=1}^{n}(k\\cdot k!+k!-k!)=\\sum_{k=1}^{n}\\left( (k+1)\\cdot k!-k! \\right)=\\sum_{k=1}^{n}(k+1)\\cdot k!-\\sum_{k=1}^{n}k!\\\\ =\\sum_{k=2}^{n+1}k!-\\sum_{k=1}^{n}k!=(n+1)!+\\sum_{k=2}^{n}k!-\\sum_{k=2}^{n}k!-1!=\\boxed{(n+1)!-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"1052\" height=\"109\" />\n</p><p>~Tomas Diaz. orders@tomasdiaz.com\n</p><p><i>Alternate solutions are always welcome. If you have a different, elegant solution to this problem, please <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit\">add it</a> to this page.</i>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO\" title=\"1969 Canadian MO\">1969 Canadian MO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems\" title=\"1969 Canadian MO Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1969 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1969 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1969 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1969 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1969 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1969 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1969 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1969 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1969 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1969 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 10\">10</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1969 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017062224\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.030 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.075 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 138/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1389/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 60/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion